.TH sway-things-hook-night-light 1 "" "Sway Things 0.5.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-night\-light \- Start the night light\*(Aqs tool (wlsunset or gammastep) as the Brightness & Night Light page says, and end it if the night light is off: run at every start and reload of sway while it is on. A night light your config starts itself, or that runs already, is left alone
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook night\-light\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start the night light\*(Aqs tool (wlsunset or gammastep) as the Brightness & Night Light page says, and end it if the night light is off: run at every start and reload of sway while it is on. A night light your config starts itself, or that runs already, is left alone
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
